1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,000
Your main account is gone. Can your team recover?

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:12,000
Blackout Protocol maps your services, their owners, and their recovery dependencies.

3
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:20,000
Choose a loss. See which work stops, and where recovery reaches a dead end. Your real accounts stay unchanged.

4
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:28,000
Prepare an independent way back. Compare a separate proposal, then assign the real preparation to its owner.

5
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:36,000
Check the recovery order together. Missing prerequisites block simulated steps, so the team can see what needs attention.

6
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:41,000
Keep a readable recovery plan, and an encrypted backup.

7
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:45,000
Blackout Protocol. Prepare your way back.
